  "description": "Bring the warmth and sweetness of the holiday season to your creative projects with this Christmas Baking & Cookies Mega Bundle, featuring 60 premium PNG clipart designs. This collection is packed with festive gingerbread cookies, decorated sugar cookies, gingerbread houses, candy canes, cupcakes, Christmas cakes, hot cocoa, baking ingredients, rolling pins, cookie cutters, peppermint treats and cozy holiday bakery arrangements. Every illustration is designed in a charming hand-painted watercolor style with rich Christmas colors, detailed icing, evergreen branches, holly berries and nostalgic seasonal accents. Each design comes as a high-resolution PNG with a transparent background, making the artwork easy to place on different creative projects without unwanted backgrounds. The files are prepared at 300 DPI for high-quality printing and digital use. Perfect for Christmas crafts, sublimation projects, invitations, stickers, scrapbooking, printable products, apparel graphics and seasonal digital designs. This mega collection includes 60 premium PNG clipart elements for maximum variety and creative flexibility. Mockup Not Included.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring the warmth and sweetness of the holiday season to your creative projects with this Christmas Baking &amp; Cookies Mega Bundle, featuring 60 premium PNG clipart designs. This collection is packed with festive gingerbread cookies, decorated sugar cookies, gingerbread houses, candy canes, cupcakes, Christmas cakes, hot cocoa, baking ingredients, rolling pins, cookie cutters, peppermint treats and cozy holiday bakery arrangements. Every illustration is designed in a charming hand-painted watercolor style with rich Christmas colors, detailed icing, evergreen branches, holly berries and nostalgic seasonal accents. Each design comes as a high-resolution PNG with a transparent background, making the artwork easy to place on different creative projects without unwanted backgrounds. The files are prepared at 300 DPI for high-quality printing and digital use. Perfect for Christmas crafts, sublimation projects, invitations, stickers, scrapbooking, printable products, apparel graphics and seasonal digital designs. This mega collection includes 60 premium PNG clipart elements for maximum variety and creative flexibility. Mockup Not Included.</p>",
